SOLUTION:
To work around this problem we used "setld -x ..." to extract the 
System 5 kit to /tmp.  Then we were able to:
 ftp the compressed tar file, SVEADM425, to another machine...
 uncompress and untar the SVEADM425 file...
 re-roll the tarball with a blocking factor of 1 
 ( tar cvbf 1 SVEADM425 opt usr var )...
 re-compress the tarfile...
 copy it back up to the production server /tmp...
 retry the setld -l operation using the kit in /tmp

