I have this reported fix for the pestilential thing. I haven't tried it yet,
but it does come from "a usually reliable source".

Here is the manual fix for the love letter virus.

1) Delete c:\windows\system\MSKernel32.vbs
2) Delete c:\windows\Win32DLL.vbs
3) Delete c:\windows\LOVE-LETTER-FOR-YOU.TXT.vbs
4) Delete the following registry keys
HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\Current
Version\RUN\MSKernel32.VBS

HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\Current Version\RUN
Services\win32DLL.vbs
5) Change the start page of your Internet Explorer as it tries to run an
.exe.

